<title>USA: 3Com, U.S. Robotics merger closes.</title>
<headline>3Com, U.S. Robotics merger closes.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corp said Thursday it has completed its merger with U.S. Robotics Corp, following shareholder approval of the deal from both companies Wednesday.</p>
<p>3Com said also that the reincorporation of the company from California to Delaware has been completed.</p>
<p>The merger, announced February 26, gives shareholders of U.S. Robotics 1.75 shares of 3Com stock for each share of U.S. Robotics stock, 3Com said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the stock deal was valued at about $8.5 billion.</p>
